From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Quinlan <mjquinlan2000@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 14:12:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] port: bound collectable type table

gen_data types the labels splat split off a bounded array; unbounded, D_80753EF0's tail kept directive widths and its f32 speed/limit were halfword-swapped, so collected items never reached their counter.

diff --git a/src/global/F9450.c b/src/global/F9450.c
index be5f279..0cc4e2e 100644
--- a/src/global/F9450.c
+++ b/src/global/F9450.c
@@ -123,7 +123,7 @@ typedef struct {
     u8 pad2C[4];
 } ModelAssetEntry;
 
-extern GridTypeEntry D_80753EF0[];
+extern GridTypeEntry D_80753EF0[0x2A]; /* PORT: bounded, so gen_data types the labels splat split off its tail */
 extern GridNode **D_80754244;
 extern DelayedSpawn *D_80754240;
 extern u16 D_807F9450;
